What is the output of the following Java program when return values interact between try, catch, and finally blocks?
```java
public class ReturnFlowApp {
    static int evaluate() {
        int num = 10;
        try {
            num = num / 0;
            return num;
        } catch (ArithmeticException e) {
            num = 20;
            return num;
        } finally {
            num = 30;
        }
    }
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        System.out.println(evaluate());
    }
}
```

